        "name": "USN-3831-2",
        "description": "USN-3831-1 fixed vulnerabilities in Ghostscript. Ghostscript 9.26 introduced a regression when used with certain options. This update fixes the problem.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that Ghostscript contained multiple security issues. If a  user or automated system were tricked into processing a specially crafted  file, a remote attacker could possibly use these issues to access arbitrary  files, execute arbitrary code, or cause a denial of service.",
